            "description": {
              "content": "Returns OAuth 2.0 Authorization Server Metadata as specified in RFC 8414. This endpoint provides automatic discovery of the authorization server's configuration, including supported endpoints, grant types, response types, PKCE methods, and available scopes. OAuth client libraries can use this endpoint to automatically configure themselves without manual endpoint configuration. No authentication is required as this is a public discovery endpoint.",
